  "configuration_id": "config_010",
  "reason": "We have only one data point (config_001: RNA-only, PCA, single profile → 48.5% acc), so the largest uncertainty is whether the image modality carries comparable or superior signal. config_010 (image_only, singleprofile, resnet50) is a clean modality comparison: it matches config_001 in profile setting and model simplicity while isolating the effect of switching from RNA to image representation. If image-only substantially outperforms 48.5%, it justifies investing remaining budget in multimodal fusion and stronger image encoders. If it underperforms, it confirms RNA as the dominant signal and redirects effort toward better RNA encoders (scvi, scgpt) and multiprofile aggregation. This single experiment resolves the most critical branching decision in the search space with minimal confounding variables."
}

